[4.020265, "o", "\u001b[3;31H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mThese are our terms.  A trade pact halves the\u001b[4;31Hoverhead on your caravans to us.  A peace pact\u001b[5;31Hmeans a year without demands or war.  An\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m \u001b[6b\u001b[6;31H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40malliance means our soldiers will march to help\u001b[7;31Hyou if you are besieged.\u001b[15;30H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[35m\u001b[40m1\u001b[37m\u001b[40m: A trade pact for \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m\u001b[40m115 gold\u001b[16;30H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[35m\u001b[40m2\u001b[37m\u001b[40m: A peace pact for \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m\u001b[40m230 gold\u001b[17;30H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[35m\u001b[40m3\u001b[37m\u001b[40m: An alliance \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[30m\u001b[40m(they won't)\u001b[18;30H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[35m\u001b[40mEsc\u001b[37m\u001b[40m: Never mind\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
